<!doctype lake><title>🦫 𝓡𝓮𝓯𝓲𝓷𝓮𝓶𝓮𝓷𝓽</title><meta name="doc-version" content="1" /><meta name="viewport" content="adapt" /><meta name="typography" content="classic" /><meta name="paragraphSpacing" content="relax" /><meta name="defaultFontsize" content="16" /><h1 data-lake-id="VZMmK" id="VZMmK" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub75bd572" id="ub75bd572"> </span><span data-lake-id="u9c15b790" id="u9c15b790">🦦</span><span data-lake-id="ucbd361ea" id="ucbd361ea"> 𝐆𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐩 𝐒𝐞𝐪𝐮𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐏𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐲 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u3f506b90" id="u3f506b90"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub924abc9" id="ub924abc9">强化学习已成为推动语言模型规模化发展的关键范式。通过大规模强化学习，语言模型能够开展更深入、更长的推理过程，从而获得解决竞赛级数学与编程等复杂问题的能力</span></strong></p><ul list="u2c1fd63c"><li fid="u7b39fc52" data-lake-id="u493c184c" id="u493c184c"><span data-lake-id="u66565495" id="u66565495">要通过增加计算投入成功扩展强化学习，首要前提是维持稳定且稳健的训练动态。以 GRPO 为代表的当前先进强化学习算法，在训练超大规模语言模型时存在严重的稳定性问题，往往导致灾难性且不可逆的模型崩溃。这种不稳定性阻碍通过持续强化学习训练进一步拓展语言模型能力边界的进程</span></li><li fid="u7b39fc52" data-lake-id="u30037c84" id="u30037c84"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2d0b9b2d" id="u2d0b9b2d" style="color: #5C0036">GRPO 的不稳定性源于其算法设计中对重要性采样权重的根本性误用及其失效。这会引入高方差的训练噪声；随着回答长度增加，这些噪声逐渐累积，并被裁剪机制进一步放大，最终导致模型崩溃</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u612b968d" id="u612b968d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3ebf7b50" id="u3ebf7b50">为解决这些核心局限，提出组序列策略优化，一种用于训练大语言模型的新型强化学习算法。GSPO 的关键创新在于，基于序列似然，以具有理论依据的方式定义重要性比率，使其符合重要性采样的基本原理</span></strong></p><ul list="ubfcbec80"><li fid="ue290a2a7" data-lake-id="u78a907f1" id="u78a907f1"><span data-lake-id="ud00e127c" id="ud00e127c">GSPO 将同一查询下多个回答的归一化奖励作为优势，确保序列级奖励与优化之间的一致性</span></li><li fid="ue290a2a7" data-lake-id="u3d2b3974" id="u3d2b3974"><span data-lake-id="ud6674134" id="ud6674134">GSPO 从机制上解决大型混合专家模型强化学习训练中的稳定性问题，无需复杂的稳定化策略，并展现出简化强化学习基础设施的潜力</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue9b71e26" id="ue9b71e26"><span data-lake-id="u6462fe4f" id="u6462fe4f">随着模型规模、稀疏性以及回答长度的增加，强化学习训练需要采用较大的采样批次规模，以最大化硬件利用率。为提高样本效率，通常会将一个大批次的采样数据划分为多个小批次，用于梯度更新。这一过程不可避免地引入离策略学习设定：回答</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22acW4j%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u04a54806" id="u04a54806">采样自旧策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F619756aa1fc9995330d2f111c852dc8f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PICiz%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc2919fc2" id="uc2919fc2">，而非正在优化的当前策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7fbcd62054bd83770c4508841ae9c9a4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jjNKZ%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u38df6a72"><li fid="ued4755a0" data-lake-id="uc8b486e9" id="uc8b486e9"><span data-lake-id="u07eb9b4e" id="u07eb9b4e">解释 PPO 和 GRPO 中裁剪机制的必要性：该机制用于防止偏离当前策略过大的样本参与梯度估计</span></li><li fid="ued4755a0" data-lake-id="u9bd96a2f" id="u9bd96a2f"><span data-lake-id="uaae7d4c6" id="uaae7d4c6">GRPO 存在一个更为根本的问题：其优化目标是不适定的。在面向长回答任务训练大型模型时，这一问题尤为突出，并会导致灾难性的模型崩溃</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc2d9bf11" id="uc2d9bf11"><strong><span data-lake-id="u95d933c5" id="u95d933c5">GRPO 优化目标的不适定性源于对重要性采样权重的误用。重要性采样的基本原理是对从行为分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbeh%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faf0d9e65cadc0ab3a490d3f106ca0dad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ei4Ru%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u16da097c" id="u16da097c">中抽取的样本进行重新加权，以估计函数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18f3c2855f0e85a1ac2257f64d917144.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22f4jQu%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f7fac5c" id="u2f7fac5c">在目标分布</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btar%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F304e3a4448ce23df8084879413b82e9f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22vx2OZ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u185ef8cd" id="u185ef8cd">下的期望</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u2702f9ca" id="u2702f9ca" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bz%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btar%7D%7D%7D%5Bf(z)%5D%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bz%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbeh%7D%7D%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btar%7D%7D(z)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbeh%7D%7D(z)%7Df(z)%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B4%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa1e3629cc84e540603bea11e60c4a117.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22knkKH%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2fe5f4c7"><li fid="u05ab9da8" data-lake-id="uc8999f4a" id="uc8999f4a"><span data-lake-id="uf52375a6" id="uf52375a6">这一过程依赖于对来自行为分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbeh%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Faf0d9e65cadc0ab3a490d3f106ca0dad.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cSLlh%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6104fb9e" id="u6104fb9e">的多个样本取平均，才能使重要性权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Btar%7D%7D(z)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bbeh%7D%7D(z)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9429164ea654944424b2839216490aec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PtYrX%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u3379dc14" id="u3379dc14">有效校正分布失配</span></li><li fid="u05ab9da8" data-lake-id="u9cdd064c" id="u9cdd064c"><span data-lake-id="u3e82eefd" id="u3e82eefd">相比之下，GRPO 在每个 token 位置</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22t%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcead1760d9d5723460c4b8d4028f113a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hmhXS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ucbfa172b" id="ucbfa172b">应用重要性权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcf06a58e1017036f6985dc78b8c9657.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YBIoL%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u017b640a" id="u017b640a">。由于这一权重仅基于从每个下一 token 分布</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F83a84dc865e76e64479156965fa2e89d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WYord%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub167e9ee" id="ub167e9ee">中抽取的单个样本</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf8c59fdae4f3076244da86294bc3ea3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22erB8z%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b244044" id="u8b244044">，因此无法发挥预期的分布校正作用</span></li><li fid="u05ab9da8" data-lake-id="u3dad2c45" id="u3dad2c45"><span data-lake-id="u7f6f4b84" id="u7f6f4b84">相反，它会向训练梯度中引入高方差噪声。这些噪声沿长序列不断累积，并被裁剪机制进一步放大</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uda68fcb6" id="uda68fcb6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5de6426b" id="u5de6426b" style="color: #AE146E">Token 级重要性权重的失效指向一项核心原则：优化目标的粒度应与奖励的粒度保持一致。由于奖励赋予的是整个序列，在 token 级别进行离策略校正便存在问题。这促使放弃 token 级优化目标，转而探索直接在</span></strong><em><strong><span data-lake-id="u3e2c3f67" id="u3e2c3f67" style="color: #AE146E">序列级别</span></strong></em><strong><span data-lake-id="u1a535083" id="u1a535083" style="color: #AE146E">应用重要性权重并执行优化</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id="cq94d" id="cq94d" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua7063ffc" id="ua7063ffc">🐌</span><span data-lake-id="u91fb0b5d" id="u91fb0b5d"> 𝐆𝐫𝐨𝐮𝐩 𝐒𝐞𝐪𝐮𝐞𝐧𝐜𝐞 𝐏𝐨𝐥𝐢𝐜𝐲 𝐎𝐩𝐭𝐢𝐦𝐢𝐳𝐚𝐭𝐢𝐨𝐧</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uc051975d" id="uc051975d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub854042d" id="ub854042d">尽管 GRPO 中的 token 级重要性权重</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcf06a58e1017036f6985dc78b8c9657.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qj7sZ%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud0b75e0b" id="ud0b75e0b">存在问题，但在语言生成场景中，序列级重要性权重</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0e7fab9c8134d76bdcfd1382346d7b61.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KJul6%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uceb6de92" id="uceb6de92">具有明确的理论含义</span></strong></p><ul list="uecf9b80f"><li fid="uc726185f" data-lake-id="ud44abb4d" id="ud44abb4d"><span data-lake-id="u9f1cf39b" id="u9f1cf39b">它反映从</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbb36413f19ff52c1f979594f3a99482d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ezbRx%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf80a70a8" id="uf80a70a8">中采样得到的回答</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ecV7u%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u540b9697" id="u540b9697">相对于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F267d9a76ec2a2db5b166c7408bebff2d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ganIi%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf940d896" id="uf940d896">的偏离程度。这与序列级奖励自然保持一致，也能够为裁剪机制提供有意义的判据</span></li><li fid="uc726185f" data-lake-id="ud972954a" id="ud972954a"><span data-lake-id="u43ef3f63" id="u43ef3f63">基于这一观察，提出</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uafff3973" id="uafff3973">组序列策略优化（Group Sequence Policy Optimization，GSPO）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7d531296" id="u7d531296">算法。GSPO 采用以下序列级优化目标</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5a9ce817" id="u5a9ce817" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGSPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B5%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd57c1fdee09eb4c084a1990a98fe8f49.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22h5nqN%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u3c1e6da7" id="u3c1e6da7" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%3D%5C%5Cfrac%7Br(x%2Cy_i)-%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bmean%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5C%7Br(x%2Cy_i)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bstd%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5C%7Br(x%2Cy_i)%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cright)%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B6%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F012229eeabfd9537d29fba02b669ccbc.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22djEvg%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2b4cff68"><li fid="u646ef56d" data-lake-id="ua752bfe3" id="ua752bfe3"><span data-lake-id="u505a77f5" id="u505a77f5">并基于序列似然定义重要性比率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40abd4f06d1cfaa64db65a38b51a8c8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fyoxD%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubfd69acb" id="ubfd69acb">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc4aba6c2" id="uc4aba6c2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%7D%3D%5C%5Cexp%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%5C%5Cright).%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B7%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F04bbfcfdc46c66abc21bc94bc65647eb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jeyia%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ua535efd4"><li fid="u45ae8c05" data-lake-id="uafb4a6a0" id="uafb4a6a0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u9609e3dc" id="u9609e3dc" style="color: #663000">因此，GSPO 对整个回答进行裁剪，而非对单个 token 进行裁剪，以将偏离当前策略过大的样本排除在梯度估计之外。这同时与序列级奖励和序列级优化保持一致。需要说明的是，在</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40abd4f06d1cfaa64db65a38b51a8c8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22j7aAT%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u13026dbc" id="u13026dbc" style="color: #663000">中采用长度归一化，以降低方差，并将</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40abd4f06d1cfaa64db65a38b51a8c8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OyCuP%22%7D" style="color: #663000"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u309b3519" id="u309b3519" style="color: #663000">控制在统一的数值范围内</span></strong></li><li fid="u45ae8c05" data-lake-id="u0620c4e1" id="u0620c4e1"><span data-lake-id="u0e901c9c" id="u0e901c9c">否则，少数 token 的似然变化就可能导致序列级重要性比率剧烈波动，而不同长度回答的重要性比率也将需要不同的裁剪范围。此外，由于重要性比率的定义不同，GSPO 与先前算法的裁剪范围通常存在数量级上的差异</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u44ec38a5" id="u44ec38a5"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc5c786e1" id="uc5c786e1" style="color: #DF2A3F">梯度分析：可以按如下方式推导 GSPO 目标的梯度</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="udf7f9d87" id="udf7f9d87" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGSPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7Ds_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Cright%5D%20%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(8)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7Ds_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cright%5D%20%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(9)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%7D%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5C%5Cright%5D.%20%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(10)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F19e3df8d7690843ee9be88d4eefef7d0.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BCTxr%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u2d299e8d"><li fid="u233393a1" data-lake-id="ub7bebf2d" id="ub7bebf2d"><span data-lake-id="u4e1a4f66" id="u4e1a4f66">作为对比，GRPO 目标的梯度如下，注意</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%3D%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F30bc2b7bdd5748e14cecf910c7c1ca78.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lFeLq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u81efee6a" id="u81efee6a">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uc154ed14" id="uc154ed14" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7BGRPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7Dw_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(11)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_i%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5C%5Cright%5D.%20%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(12)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8015e74860f1f671e835affae6409f65.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zGFFT%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u84f67046" id="u84f67046"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc6c8d4ca" id="uc6c8d4ca">GSPO 与 GRPO 的根本区别在于如何对各 token 的对数似然梯度进行加权</span></strong></p><ul list="u93371fe2"><li fid="ua0653025" data-lake-id="ubc3f0681" id="ubc3f0681"><span data-lake-id="uac3f078a" id="uac3f078a">GRPO 中，各 token 按照各自的重要性权重</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffcf06a58e1017036f6985dc78b8c9657.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lMIYl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u9ff7d411" id="u9ff7d411">进行加权。然而，这些不相等的权重可以在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22(0%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5502bebd3a1a92826b05dcb325558479.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22XiyI3%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8e02112a" id="u8e02112a">或</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%2B%5C%5Cinfty)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F41dac3682179219a6d651e6d60475489.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mPVxr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7897b26d" id="u7897b26d">内变化，其影响不可忽略，并可能随着训练推进不断累积，产生难以预测的后果</span></li><li fid="ua0653025" data-lake-id="uedc62631" id="uedc62631"><span data-lake-id="u8bb47b83" id="u8bb47b83">相比之下，GSPO 对同一回答中的所有 token 赋予相同权重，从而消除 GRPO 中的这一不稳定因素</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5558e383" id="u5558e383"><strong><span data-lake-id="u52fe1a0b" id="u52fe1a0b">在多轮强化学习等场景中，可能希望以比序列级更细的粒度调整优势。引入 GSPO 的 token 级目标函数变体 GSPO-token，以支持按 token 分别设置优势</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ue891db60" id="ue891db60" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Barray%7D%7Br%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cdisplaystyle%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGSPO-token%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Cmin%5C%5Cleft(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%5C%5C%3B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bclip%7D%5C%5Cleft(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C1-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C1%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright)%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.3em%5D%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7B(13)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Barray%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdfb1197be2c1d148742cfbc3e1962ff4.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CccAQ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue5b2d4a5" id="ue5b2d4a5" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5Bs_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5D%7D%2C%5Cn%5C%5Ctag%7B14%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fef987ac00c9de4e1cbad453c42d30beb.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22hKF4q%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u58a2c732"><li fid="u115e4ce8" data-lake-id="u3ace3536" id="u3ace3536"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5B%5C%5Ccdot%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F565766aa7dad12254e0180dc38e60cc3.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aT54b%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub66d946b" id="ub66d946b">表示仅保留数值、同时停止梯度传播，对应于 PyTorch 中的 </span><code data-lake-id="u6843fac7" id="u6843fac7"><span data-lake-id="u3e8a0101" id="u3e8a0101">detach</span></code><span data-lake-id="uf9e79f6f" id="uf9e79f6f"> 操作。GSPO-token 的梯度可推导为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5cd7e835" id="u5cd7e835" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGSPO-token%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%26%3D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7Ds_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(15)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7Ds_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%5C%5Cright%5D%20%26%5C%5Cqquad%5C%5Ctext%7B(16)%7D%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bx%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%5C%5C%2C%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Csim%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cleft%5B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5E%7BG%7D%5C%5Cleft(%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_i%5C%5Cmid%20x)%7D%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%7D%5C%5Ccdot%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%5C%5Clog%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5C%5Cright%5D.%20%26%5C%5C%5C%5C%5B-0.3em%5D%5Cn%26%26%5C%5Ctext%7B(17)%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fda94282fbfb1f1a0fcab857f5ad7967d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22K8Qem%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ucbda8b4e"><li fid="u3ef3ae60" data-lake-id="u94a409e7" id="u94a409e7"><span data-lake-id="u2f74dc99" id="u2f74dc99">注意，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Coperatorname%7Bsg%7D%5B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5C%5Cmid%20x%2Cy_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8bbdc5378263d4d6a446888be82f23fa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22dwNvH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u8b304a5f" id="u8b304a5f">在数值上等于</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%221%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F53072c2388d69edc65c2377681e4e87c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IE2Ab%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u19dd2710" id="u19dd2710">，因此</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6c516d3f10f2db6a859204b968476f0d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22qDwIm%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4f5dae66" id="u4f5dae66">与</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F40abd4f06d1cfaa64db65a38b51a8c8d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X6QEr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5ace0232" id="u5ace0232">在数值上相等。GSPO-token 与 GSPO 在优化目标、裁剪条件和理论梯度上均具有数值一致性，而 GSPO-token 在逐 token 调整优势方面具有更高的灵活性</span></li></ul><h1 data-lake-id="yDwJO" id="yDwJO" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u98992b2e" id="u98992b2e">🦨</span><span data-lake-id="u39c1b50c" id="u39c1b50c"> 𝓢𝓸𝓯𝓽 𝓐𝓭𝓪𝓹𝓽𝓲𝓿𝓮 𝓟𝓸𝓵𝓲𝓬𝔂 𝓞𝓹𝓽𝓲𝓶𝓲𝔃𝓪𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷</span></h1><p data-lake-id="u104fced2" id="u104fced2"><strong><span data-lake-id="ud4567a6d" id="ud4567a6d">1. 背景与挑战：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8799ce20" id="u8799ce20">强化学习（RL）在增强大语言模型（LLM）推理能力方面日益重要，但实现稳定且高性能的策略优化仍具挑战性。Token 级别的重要性比率通常表现出高方差，这种现象在混合专家（MoE）模型中更为严重，会导致更新不稳定</span></p><p data-lake-id="u3bc38ae1" id="u3bc38ae1"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucc6a8e61" id="ucc6a8e61">2. 现有方法的局限性：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud5c4b334" id="ud5c4b334">现有的基于群组的策略优化方法（如 GSPO 和 GRPO）通过硬截断（hard clipping）来缓解上述问题，但这使得难以同时维持训练稳定性和有效学习 </span></p><p data-lake-id="ua5ce5be4" id="ua5ce5be4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u59e511ed" id="u59e511ed">3. 提出的方法：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufee4af97" id="ufee4af97">论文提出</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4ba7c8d9" id="u4ba7c8d9">软自适应策略优化（SAPO）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u173392df" id="u173392df">，用一种平滑的、温度控制的门控机制取代硬截断。该机制能自适应地衰减（减弱）偏离策略的更新，同时保留有用的学习信号</span></p><p data-lake-id="u20476d44" id="u20476d44"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc05e8089" id="uc05e8089">4. SAPO 的核心优势与对比</span></strong></p><ul list="uf9df0648"><li fid="u15a1cd1f" data-lake-id="ube1089d8" id="ube1089d8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0621fae5" id="u0621fae5">综合特性：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u251c2dfd" id="u251c2dfd">相比 GSPO 和 GRPO，SAPO 兼具序列连贯性（sequence-coherent）和 Token 自适应性（token-adaptive）</span></li><li fid="u15a1cd1f" data-lake-id="ud031280c" id="ud031280c"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue37e5390" id="ue37e5390">对比 GSPO：</span></strong></li></ul><ul list="uf9df0648" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u3944fee6" data-lake-id="u212c2e3a" id="u212c2e3a"><span data-lake-id="ud441b648" id="ud441b648">SAPO 像 GSPO 一样保持序列级连贯性，但其软门控形成一个连续的信任区域，避免 GSPO 中使用的脆弱硬截断带</span></li><li fid="u3944fee6" data-lake-id="u2c081d11" id="u2c081d11"><span data-lake-id="uef3803a1" id="uef3803a1">当一个序列包含少量高度偏离策略的 Token 时，GSPO 会抑制该序列的所有梯度；而 SAPO 仅选择性地降低那些违规 Token 的权重，并保留接近当前策略 Token 的学习信号，从而提高样本效率</span></li></ul><ul list="uf9df0648" start="3"><li fid="u15a1cd1f" data-lake-id="u15e127cc" id="u15e127cc"><strong><span data-lake-id="u22199424" id="u22199424">对比 GRPO：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua973b273" id="ua973b273">SAPO 将 GRPO 的硬性 Token 级截断替换为平滑的、温度控制的缩放，从而实现信息量更大且更稳定的更新</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ua73812b6" id="ua73812b6" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="image" value="data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2026%2Fpng%2F38583525%2F1769300467954-9095561c-8c55-4c16-81f0-8f86e4066630.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u6b9edf13-6032-4052-9453-759d0283316%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u084fe131-2f0a-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A850.6364135742188%2C%22height%22%3A347%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A114135%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1675%2C%22originHeight%22%3A683%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.375%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22FIGURE1%3ACOMPARISONOFPOLICV-UPDATEOBIECTIVESUNDERPOSTIVEADVANTAGE.THELEFTPANELSHOWSTHE%22%2C%22x%22%3A3%2C%22y%22%3A559%2C%22width%22%3A1666%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SUROGATEOBECTIVEVALUE%3BTHERIGHTPANELSHOWSTHECORRESPONDINGGRADIENTWEIGHT%2C(0LASAFUNCION%22%2C%22x%22%3A6%2C%22y%22%3A600%2C%22width%22%3A1666%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22OFTHEPOLICYRATIOR(0).%22%2C%22x%22%3A6%2C%22y%22%3A637%2C%22width%22%3A452%2C%22height%22%3A32%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E8%8E%B2%22%2C%22x%22%3A16%2C%22y%22%3A137%2C%22width%22%3A29%2C%22height%22%3A235%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FTGATE(T%3D3.O%22%2C%22x%22%3A1342%2C%22y%22%3A21%2C%22width%22%3A170%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22ARDCLIP%22%2C%22x%22%3A441%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TE(T%3D1.%22%2C%22x%22%3A829%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A91%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22TE(T%3D2.%22%2C%22x%22%3A1115%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A95%2C%22height%22%3A17%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.(0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A411%2C%22y%22%3A485%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A24%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22CLIPPE%22%2C%22x%22%3A241%2C%22y%22%3A24%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTGA%22%2C%22x%22%3A759%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A81%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22FGAT%22%2C%22x%22%3A1059%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A66%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22PPINA%22%2C%22x%22%3A509%2C%22y%22%3A25%2C%22width%22%3A64%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A851%2C%22y%22%3A420%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22I.(0)%22%2C%22x%22%3A1255%2C%22y%22%3A488%2C%22width%22%3A56%2C%22height%22%3A20%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22--UNC%22%2C%22x%22%3A184%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A76%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2208%22%2C%22x%22%3A858%2C%22y%22%3A128%2C%22width%22%3A36%2C%22height%22%3A46%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.%22%2C%22x%22%3A858%2C%22y%22%3A211%2C%22width%22%3A30%2C%22height%22%3A27%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.2%22%2C%22x%22%3A858%2C%22y%22%3A355%2C%22width%22%3A34%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%220.4%22%2C%22x%22%3A854%2C%22y%22%3A281%2C%22width%22%3A38%2C%22height%22%3A22%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22SOFTG%22%2C%22x%22%3A1326%2C%22y%22%3A23%2C%22width%22%3A65%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A838%2C%22y%22%3A228%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A43%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A867%2C%22y%22%3A70%2C%22width%22%3A24%2C%22height%22%3A25%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22.0%22%2C%22x%22%3A911%2C%22y%22%3A22%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A18%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%22%2C%22x%22%3A27%2C%22y%22%3A240%2C%22width%22%3A20%2C%22height%22%3A171%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f5f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ub911bff4%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub22142ef" id="ub22142ef"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ec8b80b" id="u5ec8b80b" style="color: #70000D">RL 为什么成为 LLM 后训练关键驱动力</span></strong></p><ul list="udc54cdfc"><li fid="u6ad5896c" data-lake-id="u531d2ece" id="u531d2ece"><strong><span data-lake-id="ue4cb5d89" id="ue4cb5d89">RL 已成为推动 LLM 近期进展的重要因素</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8705403e" id="u8705403e">，使模型在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9c9a1c04" id="u9c9a1c04">数学、编程、多模态理解</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u45b5d785" id="u45b5d785">等高难任务上具备更深、更长的推理能力</span></li><li fid="u6ad5896c" data-lake-id="u934b869c" id="u934b869c"><span data-lake-id="u5cb7248f" id="u5cb7248f">在众多 RL 做法中，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucea8207a" id="ucea8207a">group-based policy optimization</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1a06bc35" id="u1a06bc35"> 被认为是一个实用配方：对每个 query </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u131dcbd0" id="u131dcbd0">采样多个回复</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u9036ee5d" id="u9036ee5d">，对</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u85c0386d" id="u85c0386d">序列级 reward 做组内归一化</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc82a8127" id="uc82a8127">，并用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u9b3f7619" id="u9b3f7619">当前策略与行为策略之间的 importance ratio</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf36115d6" id="uf36115d6">对更新加权</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u4deb95e9" id="u4deb95e9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u217a9778" id="u217a9778" style="color: #70000D">核心挑战：token-level importance ratio 高方差导致更新不稳</span></strong></p><ul list="uf863a30e"><li fid="u3c344a61" data-lake-id="u2c978e0f" id="u2c978e0f"><span data-lake-id="u26096813" id="u26096813">该范式下的中心难点是：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u8024497a" id="u8024497a">token-level importance ratio 的方差很高</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u730efc38" id="u730efc38">。这一问题在 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0ed3b5e4" id="u0ed3b5e4">MoE</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7099b0ea" id="u7099b0ea"> 中更严重：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u810d4f30" id="u810d4f30">routing heterogeneity</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u051aa6fa" id="u051aa6fa"> 与 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc97757ae" id="uc97757ae">long responses</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ubd495d09" id="ubd495d09"> 会放大 token 间偏差，从而提高不稳定更新概率</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u36b98eec" id="u36b98eec"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub2e57157" id="ub2e57157" style="color: #70000D">现有应对：hard clipping 的带宽两难</span></strong></p><ul list="u4bb20a33"><li fid="uf34d0aab" data-lake-id="uccba0ac0" id="uccba0ac0"><span data-lake-id="u8b927dbb" id="u8b927dbb">以 GRPO 为例，常用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue5964e30" id="ue5964e30">hard clipping</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u33d4fae2" id="u33d4fae2"> 来约束大偏差：当 ratio 超出固定 band 时，直接</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6ce6d686" id="u6ce6d686">把梯度置零</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4acf58d8" id="u4acf58d8">以防止过大步长</span></li></ul><ul list="u80354e0f" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="u8df50718" data-lake-id="u78f49a18" id="u78f49a18"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8d701da9" id="u8d701da9">clip 太紧</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue7f9b8cc" id="ue7f9b8cc">：有效样本（可用于梯度计算的 token/序列）变少</span></li><li fid="u8df50718" data-lake-id="u50955184" id="u50955184"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2abda732" id="u2abda732">clip 太松</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u54cc21ea" id="u54cc21ea">：off-policy 样本带来的噪声梯度进入更新，训练更不稳定</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ueab8894d" id="ueab8894d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7970e9b6" id="u7970e9b6" style="color: #70000D">方法动机：SAPO 用软门控替代 hard clipping，构造连续信任域</span></strong></p><ul list="ud49816fc"><li fid="u3552a34f" data-lake-id="u7508b062" id="u7508b062"><span data-lake-id="u3da410d5" id="u3da410d5">为解决 hard clipping 的脆弱性，作者提出 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2fb718bd" id="u2fb718bd">SAPO</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u46e7e813" id="u46e7e813">：用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u45875eaf" id="u45875eaf">温度控制的 soft gate </span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud8f29652" id="ud8f29652">替代 hard clipping</span></li><li fid="u3552a34f" data-lake-id="u2fc84702" id="u2fc84702"><span data-lake-id="ucabbba3c" id="ucabbba3c">对 token 更新按一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5ad4aeb4" id="u5ad4aeb4">有界、sigmoid 形状</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc94adbb9" id="uc94adbb9">的函数加权，该函数以 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3dd5c50d" id="u3dd5c50d">on-policy 点（ratio≈1）为中心</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua59d41e0" id="ua59d41e0">。由此实现一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua1514403" id="ua1514403">continuous trust region</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucfe79ceb" id="ucfe79ceb">：</span></li></ul><ul list="u89b93807" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="ub92f682e" data-lake-id="ub322beec" id="ub322beec"><span data-lake-id="u19a43745" id="u19a43745">在 on-policy 附近，梯度被保留以支持有效更新与探索</span></li><li fid="ub92f682e" data-lake-id="u7caaeee6" id="u7caaeee6"><span data-lake-id="u811fa425" id="u811fa425">ratio 偏离时，梯度</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uab59c959" id="uab59c959">平滑衰减而不是直接截断</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u47a1322c" id="u47a1322c">，从而在抑制噪声的同时，仍保留中等偏差样本的学习信号</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5af2c97c" id="u5af2c97c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0646867f" id="u0646867f" style="color: #70000D">关键细节：为何需要正/负 token 非对称温度</span></strong></p><ul list="u0a16b30c"><li fid="u7b91273a" data-lake-id="u7488726b" id="u7488726b"><span data-lake-id="ud9da97e9" id="ud9da97e9">作者进一步强调，为在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ucc292059" id="ucc292059">大词表</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1a36df8f" id="u1a36df8f">下更稳健，SAPO 对</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua2bb5498" id="ua2bb5498">正 token</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u71bacda7" id="u71bacda7">与</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1c4c44f7" id="u1c4c44f7">负 token</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u50b28cbe" id="u50b28cbe">采用</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua9ee65d5" id="ua9ee65d5">非对称温度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u54efc349" id="u54efc349">，让负 token 的梯度衰减更快</span></li><li fid="u7b91273a" data-lake-id="uce99594d" id="uce99594d"><span data-lake-id="u99d959b2" id="u99d959b2">引言给出的理由是：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua3fca364" id="ua3fca364">负向更新</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud2d13a2c" id="ud2d13a2c">往往会抬高许多不合适 token 的 logits，因此相比正向更新更容易引入不稳定</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf14e955d" id="uf14e955d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u843acd78" id="u843acd78" style="color: #70000D">方法定位：同时做到 sequence-coherent 与 token-adaptive</span></strong></p><ul list="u20c88fc2"><li fid="u8335c77d" data-lake-id="u901e315f" id="u901e315f"><span data-lake-id="u3189ec4a" id="u3189ec4a">在作者定义的常见条件下（</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua2c87ef3" id="ua2c87ef3">on-policy 小步长</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1f5d4486" id="u1f5d4486"> + </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u708062d7" id="u708062d7">同一序列内 token log-ratio 低离散度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1ecea6d0" id="u1ecea6d0">），</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6fa166e2" id="u6fa166e2">平均 token gate 会集中为一个平滑的序列级 gate</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u66646d96" id="u66646d96">，使优化与序列级 reward 对齐，风格上接近 GSPO</span></li><li fid="u8335c77d" data-lake-id="u8b31b103" id="u8b31b103"><span data-lake-id="u509a64a6" id="u509a64a6">当条件被破坏（存在</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u73052f84" id="u73052f84">异质 token</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u749862bf" id="u749862bf">或</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u82459b08" id="u82459b08">离群 token</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u69d33918" id="u69d33918">）时，SAPO 会</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u4d0e25a4" id="u4d0e25a4">只下调 offending tokens</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue3c06478" id="ue3c06478">，并保留同一序列内 near-on-policy token 的有效梯度；作者强调这能减少 hard clipping 带来的信号损失，从而提升采样效率并保持稳定更新</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0b008fbd" id="u0b008fbd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3641b483" id="u3641b483" style="color: #70000D">经验性结论</span></strong></p><ul list="u340b65cb"><li fid="ub38b1f05" data-lake-id="ub3f861e9" id="ub3f861e9"><span data-lake-id="ue5ada856" id="ue5ada856">与 GSPO/GRPO 相比，SAPO 在经验上表现为：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue59161c7" id="ue59161c7">更好的稳定性与任务性能</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u3b337266" id="u3b337266">；尽管所有方法最终可能出现不稳定迹象，但 SAPO 能维持更久的 coherent learning，并在发散前达到更高 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u905e061a" id="u905e061a">Pass@1</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u5e708efa" id="u5e708efa">​</span></li><li fid="ub38b1f05" data-lake-id="u97d1586e" id="u97d1586e"><span data-lake-id="u4b8e2be7" id="u4b8e2be7">温度消融进一步指出：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1838120b" id="u1838120b">负 token 用更大温度（让其梯度更快衰减）是关键</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u7d854721" id="u7d854721">，能显著降低早期崩溃风险</span></li><li fid="ub38b1f05" data-lake-id="u77988fd2" id="u77988fd2"><span data-lake-id="ubfd4021f" id="ubfd4021f">在更贴近真实系统的训练中，SAPO 也被用于 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u38cf126b" id="u38cf126b">Qwen3-VL</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u914e2eff" id="u914e2eff"> 的实际训练，覆盖文本与多模态任务、不同规模与架构，作者称其同样有效</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="kxRjT" id="kxRjT" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u1c00784a" id="u1c00784a">🪺</span><span data-lake-id="ua7ee99af" id="ua7ee99af"> 𝓟𝓻𝓮𝓵𝓲𝓶𝓲𝓷𝓪𝓻𝓲𝓮𝓼</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uf7ba92ae" id="uf7ba92ae"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub7a81bcf" id="ub7a81bcf" style="color: #70000D">基础符号定义 (Notation)</span></strong></p><ul list="u836dfe22"><li fid="u1d28b690" data-lake-id="u28fce97a" id="u28fce97a"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3b5c30b7" id="u3b5c30b7">模型建模：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u760c4e4b" id="u760c4e4b"> 将自回归大语言模型（LLM）建模为参数化为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctheta%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fed5a4aa5e092e303a69c608582c70db9.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mivzF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u4dfb87b9" id="u4dfb87b9">的随机策略 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8e9808ff98b9bc6839ec21cbba8fe05b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MZOWN%22%7D"></card></li><li fid="u1d28b690" data-lake-id="ufb912a1b" id="ufb912a1b"><strong><span data-lake-id="u27a4e05b" id="u27a4e05b">概率分解：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc1989382" id="uc1989382"> 给定查询</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OV4Ec%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufc548368" id="ufc548368">，回复</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22y%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fbf98c0ddcbe9c1e535f767c78c3aa813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SnKUV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u16992ba4" id="u16992ba4">的生成概率被分解为所有 Token 条件概率的乘积：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y%7Cq)%3D%5C%5Cprod_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy%7C%7D%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(y_%7Bt%7D%7Cq%2Cy_%7B%3Ct%7D)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8287f931641bf2f1d9c230376d8cca90.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22QoKBS%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u020198a7" id="u020198a7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0c7a2ae9" id="u0c7a2ae9" style="color: #70000D">群组相对策略优化 (GRPO) 是目前主流的 RL 方法，其核心机制如下</span></strong></p><ul list="ud7ceb90d"><li fid="u33ff1c2e" data-lake-id="u816f30b8" id="u816f30b8"><strong><span data-lake-id="u944e48f5" id="u944e48f5">群组采样 (Group Sampling)：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub2910c9c" id="ub2910c9c"> 针对每个查询 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22q%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F34c7b563b30bde3c748139530686798e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22AhtU2%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="udb63ab59" id="udb63ab59">，从旧策略</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7Bold%7D%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fdd02a7b0f54603f2316cbd320fbc15bf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22X8YMq%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uc4b2a092" id="uc4b2a092">中采样一组</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22G%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff8df64a4bfdeb9bdcbc357668b6fb123.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IR8cl%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6f9be3fc" id="u6f9be3fc"> 个 回复 </span></li><li fid="u33ff1c2e" data-lake-id="u97900182" id="u97900182"><strong><span data-lake-id="u01108f78" id="u01108f78">群组归一化优势 (Group-normalized Advantage)：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u79c26a83" id="u79c26a83"> 不使用额外的 Critic 模型，而是通过计算组内奖励的均值和标准差来归一化计算优势值</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Chat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F371e861621451c9ece01c17da6460419.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TeRft%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf096bda0" id="uf096bda0">。这意味着同一个回复中的所有 Token 共享同一个优势值</span></li><li fid="u33ff1c2e" data-lake-id="u6f581c6c" id="u6f581c6c"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0434a04a" id="u0434a04a">Token 级硬截断：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u1a6b51a3" id="u1a6b51a3"> 优化目标是 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u5efa12ed" id="u5efa12ed">Token 级别</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udc7ed7c4" id="udc7ed7c4"> 的。它计算每个 Token 的重要性比率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F4323480e5da85abf6a01751172ceb51c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ivHSc%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u974fbd67" id="u974fbd67">，并使用 PPO 风格的 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf3c7870f" id="uf3c7870f">硬截断 (Hard Clipping)</span></strong><span data-lake-id="udd7435a2" id="udd7435a2"> 将其限制在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5B1-%5C%5Cepsilon%2C%201%2B%5C%5Cepsilon%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F18019f476bfde1722b8e0d074f8cd5d1.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CFaJV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua0b15974" id="ua0b15974">范围内，以防止更新步长过大</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u48c507bd" id="u48c507bd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGRPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cq)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Cmin%20%5C%5Cleft(%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bclip%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%201-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%201%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fab4d9e6a8b6541f28b55bdf3e93d876e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CK91T%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="udf2c56cd" id="udf2c56cd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BR_i%20-%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bmean%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_j%5C%5C%7D_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5EG)%7D%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bstd%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_j%5C%5C%7D_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5EG)%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5f66ee29d15c3a05114f48625fceed01.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VIvnT%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u9a8f48b7" id="u9a8f48b7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8375d6ad" id="u8375d6ad" style="color: #70000D">群组序列策略优化 (GSPO) 是另一种基于序列的方法：</span></strong></p><ul list="ud496c5b8"><li fid="u31813258" data-lake-id="u07858337" id="u07858337"><strong><span data-lake-id="u7f4e54a5" id="u7f4e54a5">序列级优化：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u465a6c6f" id="u465a6c6f">与 GRPO 不同，GSPO 采用 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u3d021fab" id="u3d021fab">序列级别 (Sequence-level)</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc7b37b50" id="uc7b37b50"> 的优化目标</span></li><li fid="u31813258" data-lake-id="ua65927b5" id="ua65927b5"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua2d02d15" id="ua2d02d15">长度归一化比率：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufc60fab9" id="ufc60fab9">它定义一个序列级的重要性比率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F328f7a092a27394bc8cc996e32331875.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DXhrr%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u34ef8b0e" id="u34ef8b0e">，这是 Token 级比率的几何平均值（经过长度归一化）。这种处理方式降低方差，使得不同长度的回复在数值上更一致</span></li><li fid="u31813258" data-lake-id="u9c530718" id="u9c530718"><strong><span data-lake-id="u0097af70" id="u0097af70">序列级截断：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u72fcfa8f" id="u72fcfa8f"> GSPO 对这个序列级比率</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F328f7a092a27394bc8cc996e32331875.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MV4pS%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u68cb3e3e" id="u68cb3e3e">进行截断，而不是对每个单独的 Token 进行截断</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5f0d7111" id="u5f0d7111" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGSPO%7D%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cq)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cmin%20%5C%5Cleft(%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%2C%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bclip%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%201-%5C%5Cvarepsilon%2C%201%2B%5C%5Cvarepsilon%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc601d50b8756e7fc172f6293e1549936.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22adz2X%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uc32ccafe" id="uc32ccafe" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%7Cq)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_i%7Cq)%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cexp%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7BR_i%20-%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bmean%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_j%5C%5C%7D_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5EG)%7D%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bstd%7D(%5C%5C%7BR_j%5C%5C%7D_%7Bj%3D1%7D%5EG)%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff97f5c7e3d11a8c69d7475e751187942.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22mxkDX%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u7e2c7215" id="u7e2c7215"><strong><span data-lake-id="u4880fb4d" id="u4880fb4d" style="color: #70000D">总结对比</span></strong></p><ul list="u4a16e9ea"><li fid="uff5a5d21" data-lake-id="u3cc2c912" id="u3cc2c912"><strong><span data-lake-id="u39880ab1" id="u39880ab1">GRPO</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u4a002435" id="u4a002435">：token 级硬剪裁 → band 外 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uec1f6be0" id="uec1f6be0">token 直接 0 梯度</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0973a1e9" id="u0973a1e9">，稳定/效率靠 ε 走钢丝</span></li><li fid="uff5a5d21" data-lake-id="ua137fbd1" id="ua137fbd1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u38f6f409" id="u38f6f409">GSPO</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u908d0280" id="u908d0280">：序列级硬机制 → 少数异常 token 会让</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc0c88e6a" id="uc0c88e6a">整句梯度被压掉</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub9c7ae2b" id="ub9c7ae2b">，缺少 token 级自适应</span></li></ul><h2 data-lake-id="oAKGW" id="oAKGW" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ua510c35e" id="ua510c35e"> </span><span data-lake-id="u696d0f5b" id="u696d0f5b">🐳</span><span data-lake-id="u3d1b26c4" id="u3d1b26c4"> 𝓢𝓸𝓯𝓽 𝓐𝓭𝓪𝓹𝓽𝓲𝓿𝓮 𝓟𝓸𝓵𝓲𝓬𝔂 𝓞𝓹𝓽𝓲𝓶𝓲𝔃𝓪𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷</span></h2><p data-lake-id="uced90e68" id="uced90e68"><strong><span data-lake-id="u6641b029" id="u6641b029" style="color: rgb(34, 73, 254),rgb(199, 74, 168)">SAPO 的定位：用于 LLM 的 RL 微调，是一种平滑 + 自适应的 policy-gradient 方法，用温度控制的 soft gate（软门控）替换 group-based 方法里常见的 hard clipping（硬截断）</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u7c118119" id="u7c118119"><strong><span data-lake-id="u65cc31f8" id="u65cc31f8">大模型训练必需的扩展</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ue83570b0" id="ue83570b0">：</span></p><ul list="u35be44b2"><li fid="uaea69512" data-lake-id="u67bb5165" id="u67bb5165"><strong><span data-lake-id="u74d13c7d" id="u74d13c7d">token-level soft trust region</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8e351416" id="u8e351416">（token 级软信任域），并且它会自然地产生 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u465fa8ca" id="u465fa8ca">sequence-level coherence</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub64f60be" id="ub64f60be">（序列级一致性）</span></li><li fid="uaea69512" data-lake-id="u59a595b3" id="u59a595b3"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub285aaec" id="ub285aaec">asymmetric temperature</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u229fd0fe" id="u229fd0fe">（非对称温度）：针对</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u05df6354" id="u05df6354">正/负 token 更新</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6cd27ef8" id="u6cd27ef8">行为不同而设计</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ud6a5af2c" id="ud6a5af2c"><span data-lake-id="u195d2796" id="u195d2796">🧱</span><span data-lake-id="u17fd42b7" id="u17fd42b7"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u269e7581" id="u269e7581">SAPO 最大化下面的目标函数：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uf4ef4947" id="uf4ef4947" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cq)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F12fe6b6413ae2e55e52ea9db3bf4e6aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s8cdJ%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2c13cb3f" id="u2c13cb3f"><span data-lake-id="u53366f6d" id="u53366f6d">🧱</span><span data-lake-id="u1421cf98" id="u1421cf98"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u2e19bf2f" id="u2e19bf2f">其中 gate（门控）函数定义为：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="ud25a45c9" id="ud25a45c9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(x)%20%3D%20%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20(x%20-%201)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B4%7D%7B%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Ctau_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bpos%7D%7D%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%3E%200%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctau_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bneg%7D%7D%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd5344114f00d4fe0994d8ae7ab436468.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MyzgG%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2e73eed6" id="u2e73eed6"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2e3e7b14" id="u2e3e7b14" style="color: #70000D">对目标求导后的梯度形式与软信任域的含义： 给出一个带权重的 log-policy gradient：</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="uac7bb3a8" id="uac7bb3a8" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cq)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20w_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5C%2C%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6baa3a5b52f3757ff64ecc567997b9ec.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22LRlre%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u247ecec4" id="u247ecec4" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%204%20%5C%5C%2C%20p_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cleft(1%20-%20p_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20p_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Csigma%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc68b2f5854555a4fc988ce3705e1425f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Ba9VP%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ub5068621"><li fid="u252bfc1e" data-lake-id="uad034767" id="uad034767"><span data-lake-id="u1d7e985d" id="u1d7e985d">​</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22w_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1dfbb2538d3ba951541028f33bcaecb6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CiC5F%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u25103194" id="u25103194">在 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe54352b4ee2f5577dbc6d1cb2341c811.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22GhR6P%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="uec34cf45" id="uec34cf45">处取峰值 1</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u984d37af" id="u984d37af">，当 ratio 偏离 1 时会</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6a4e8df4" id="u6a4e8df4">平滑衰减</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u6d421f53" id="u6d421f53">（并且近似指数衰减）</span></li><li fid="u252bfc1e" data-lake-id="uae96208b" id="uae96208b"><span data-lake-id="u90de0a60" id="u90de0a60">实现一个</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ufe0e8d17" id="ufe0e8d17">soft trust region</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0ccbf889" id="u0ccbf889">：偏离小 → 梯度保留；偏离大 → 梯度连续变小，而不是突然截断为 0。</span></li><li fid="u252bfc1e" data-lake-id="u1202497d" id="u1202497d"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3904f272" id="u3904f272">关键不变性</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u44258654" id="u44258654">：当</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D1%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe54352b4ee2f5577dbc6d1cb2341c811.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x1CWs%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ue7996b4b" id="ue7996b4b">时，soft gate 的梯度与未截断目标的梯度</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ud8dadf88" id="ud8dadf88">相同</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub28c9f00" id="ub28c9f00">，而且</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u0a937ba7" id="u0a937ba7">与 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd0660784ae953829ecc20c4e1eb836f6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22bKAPY%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u1b2294e8" id="u1b2294e8"> 无关</span></strong></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u197a00b1" id="u197a00b1"><strong><span data-lake-id="u961bf4f5" id="u961bf4f5" style="color: #70000D">对比结论：同时具备 sequence-coherent 与 token-adaptive</span></strong></p><ul list="u33634954"><li fid="ubd8d8c94" data-lake-id="u2ebb705d" id="u2ebb705d"><strong><span data-lake-id="uccc96511" id="uccc96511">相对 GSPO：SAPO 在温和条件下会收敛为序列级门控形式。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf90751aa" id="uf90751aa">在小步长 on-policy + 序列内 token log-ratio 离散度低的假设下，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u308a9ce0" id="u308a9ce0">平均 token gate 会集中为一个平滑的 sequence gate</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0d72cb62" id="u0d72cb62">：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u6ec086d2" id="u6ec086d2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g(%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E2%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe897258afa32f51892d34a069185fbce.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VjZK7%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u637b26dc" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="uc2c59ad4" data-lake-id="uf6da9171" id="uf6da9171"><span data-lake-id="ua2991dd4" id="ua2991dd4">因而 SAPO 像 GSPO 一样能对齐 sequence reward，但区别是：SAPO 的信任域是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u11a843a6" id="u11a843a6">连续</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u02927088" id="u02927088">的，不是 GSPO 的 hard clipping band</span></li><li fid="uc2c59ad4" data-lake-id="u83a9f5bb" id="u83a9f5bb"><span data-lake-id="ub8ca4049" id="ub8ca4049">当序列里只有少数 token 极端 off-policy 把</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F99fef66755b65b72ae46f4fdc159c96e.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22x4qiy%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2a9aaea5" id="u2a9aaea5">推出 GSPO 的硬带宽时，GSPO 会把这条序列的很多近 on-policy token 梯度也一起压掉；SAPO 则只下调违规 token，保留其余 token 的学习信号</span></li></ul><ul list="u637b26dc"><li fid="ud1233e7d" data-lake-id="u0595cc58" id="u0595cc58"><strong><span data-lake-id="uecd041f8" id="uecd041f8">相对 GRPO：SAPO 避免 token 级 hard clipping 的超界即置零。</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uf9a71aab" id="uf9a71aab">GRPO 在固定范围外会把 token 梯度直接置零；SAPO 则是</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u639f9cc7" id="u639f9cc7">连续缩放</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud8babaf6" id="ud8babaf6">，更平衡地保留有用信号 + 防止不稳定的大步长</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u0cea1abd" id="u0cea1abd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u639ff083" id="u639ff083" style="color: #70000D">为什么要给正/负 advantage 用不同温度</span></strong></p><ul list="u88feb85f"><li fid="u044e9a23" data-lake-id="u33fcfcb7" id="u33fcfcb7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2f731b0d" id="u2f731b0d">负向 token 更新通常比正向更不稳定</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u968f7dc5" id="u968f7dc5">，并从梯度如何在 logits 上传播来解释。设 logits 向量</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z%3D%5Bz_1%2C%5C%5Cdots%2Cz_%7B%7CV%7C%7D%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8b8b33d5bfdfe37fe7c7c87d7483ff2b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ixPEV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ua5407e19" id="ua5407e19">，</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa770a282bbfa0ae1ec474b7ed311656d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IVxrV%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubab4b30d" id="ubab4b30d"> 为任意 token；softmax 概率：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u5778b4d9" id="u5778b4d9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta%7D(v%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cexp(z_v)%20%2F%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bv'%7D%20%5C%5Cexp(z_%7Bv'%7D).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F926f54e6cefe4e1999212ab21fd97594.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22TzpM8%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u88feb85f" start="2"><li fid="u044e9a23" data-lake-id="u061f71a1" id="u061f71a1"><span data-lake-id="u8c739be9" id="u8c739be9"> 给出对任意 logit </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_v%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fcf0dea4b5076efaabfe025da521ff57b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22OdKz8%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub35462f5" id="ub35462f5"> 的偏导，最后化简成下面的分段形式</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u01c71e2a" id="u01c71e2a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z_v%7D%20%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpartial%20z_v%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cmathbb%7BI%7D(v%20%3D%20y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D)%20%5C%5Cexp(z_%7By_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D)%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bv'%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BV%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cexp(z_%7Bv'%7D)%20-%20%5C%5Cexp(z_%7By_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D)%20%5C%5Cexp(z_v)%7D%7B(%5C%5Csum_%7Bv'%20%5C%5Cin%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BV%7D%7D%20%5C%5Cexp(z_%7Bv'%7D))%5E2%7D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20(1%20-%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D))%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bif%20%7D%20v%20%3D%20y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7B(sampled%20token)%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20-%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(v%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%26%20%5C%5Ctext%7Botherwise%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctext%7B(unsampled%20token)%7D%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F81edbc0103ccdec2c1139e10d7093189.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22rtli6%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ub4b02446" id="ub4b02446"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3781c090" id="u3781c090">1. 超参数</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7ccb9bf589e539415d2ed8b202fb932.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Omo21%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ue9976314" id="ue9976314">的作用：</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7ccb9bf589e539415d2ed8b202fb932.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22aXYHA%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5e25045e" id="u5e25045e">控制权重的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u7cb7c676" id="u7cb7c676">衰减速率</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8a048e6f" id="u8a048e6f">：</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fe7ccb9bf589e539415d2ed8b202fb932.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uJtvH%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ud7b825e8" id="ud7b825e8">值越大，当新旧策略出现偏差时，权重下降得越快（即门控关得越紧，过滤越严格）</span></p><p data-lake-id="u1d858964" id="u1d858964"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua1fc4780" id="ua1fc4780">2. 负向样本的不稳定性（核心原因）</span></strong></p><ul list="u59086bf6"><li fid="u31e8b269" data-lake-id="u6d7a778d" id="u6d7a778d"><span data-lake-id="u753387c3" id="u753387c3">虽然负向 Token（即模型预测错误的词）对于探索和防止过拟合很重要，但它们比正向 Token 更容易引入训练的不稳定性</span></li><li fid="u31e8b269" data-lake-id="ueb8d29fe" id="ueb8d29fe"><strong><span data-lake-id="u241a2ca4" id="u241a2ca4">数学机制（Softmax 的挤压效应）：</span></strong></li></ul><ul list="u59086bf6" data-lake-indent="1"><li fid="ud56297d1" data-lake-id="u8f86aca9" id="u8f86aca9"><strong><span data-lake-id="u5b47b3b9" id="u5b47b3b9">正向更新（Positive）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uc69a7f53" id="uc69a7f53"> 提高目标 Token 的 Logit 值，自然压低其他所有未采样 Token 的值，这通常是聚焦且安全的</span><span data-lake-id="uf98552dd" id="uf98552dd">。</span></li><li fid="ud56297d1" data-lake-id="u192dc1b5" id="u192dc1b5"><strong><span data-lake-id="uf630b9d0" id="uf630b9d0">负向更新（Negative）：</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u0efff8e3" id="u0efff8e3"> 降低目标 Token 的 Logit 值。由于概率总和为 1，这会</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u1a9454c0" id="u1a9454c0">被迫提高所有其他未采样 Token 的 Logit 值</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ucd8616b6" id="ucd8616b6">​</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uf3063e59" id="uf3063e59"><strong><span data-lake-id="ucc3f022b" id="ucc3f022b">3. 大词表环境下的风险</span></strong></p><ul list="uee8846a6"><li fid="u31f84fe7" data-lake-id="uf1636f73" id="uf1636f73"><span data-lake-id="uef1358a7" id="uef1358a7">LLM 的词表非常大（通常数十万个 Token），而正确的 Token 往往只有少数几个</span><span data-lake-id="ufd5601e2" id="ufd5601e2">。</span></li><li fid="u31f84fe7" data-lake-id="uc3571392" id="uc3571392"><span data-lake-id="u425dfded" id="u425dfded">负向更新会将梯度扩散到成千上万个不相关的 Token 上。这种盲目的概率提升虽然有一定正则化作用，但在策略偏离（Off-policy）时极易引入噪声和不稳定性</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u3772dc29" id="u3772dc29"><strong><span data-lake-id="u19456d88" id="u19456d88">4.  为解决上述问题，SAPO 设定负向温度大于正向温度 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctau_%7Bneg%7D%20%3E%20%5C%5Ctau_%7Bpos%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F73e1f7065dcb74bb8bd0979fe66d8782.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lCfhk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u30007de0" id="u30007de0">。这意味着对负向更新实施</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ua43efa53" id="ua43efa53">更严格的门控</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u8ca2aaa4" id="u8ca2aaa4">：一旦策略稍有偏离，负向梯度的权重就会迅速衰减。这在保留有效惩罚信号的同时，极大降低引发模型崩溃的风险</span></p><h2 data-lake-id="oWWA8" id="oWWA8" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="ub14632ca" id="ub14632ca">🦫</span><span data-lake-id="ua9573ffd" id="ua9573ffd"> 𝓐 𝓖𝓪𝓽𝓲𝓷𝓰-𝓕𝓾𝓷𝓬𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷 𝓟𝓮𝓻𝓼𝓹𝓮𝓬𝓽𝓲𝓿𝓮 𝓸𝓷 𝓢𝓐𝓟𝓞𝓼 𝓒𝓸𝓷𝓷𝓮𝓬𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷𝓼 𝓽𝓸 𝓖𝓡𝓟𝓞 𝓪𝓷𝓭 𝓖𝓢𝓟𝓞</span></h2><p data-lake-id="u66f5d137" id="u66f5d137"><strong><span data-lake-id="u8441efda" id="u8441efda">统一 surrogate 目标， 其中差异全部被塞进 </span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ccdot)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F5c8085c4c4c53958fe2b374e7d5400cf.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22axokr%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="u995e8bed" id="u995e8bed">：不同算法就是选不同的 gating function  </span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u576617b3" id="u576617b3" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D_%7Bq%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BD%7D%2C%20%5C%5C%7By_i%5C%5C%7D_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Csim%20%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(%5C%5Ccdot%7Cq)%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cright%5D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F12fe6b6413ae2e55e52ea9db3bf4e6aa.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22MnzJ9%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u6c4b471d" id="u6c4b471d"><strong><span data-lake-id="ub30cc00e" id="ub30cc00e">把 token ratio 汇总成 sequence ratio，并构造一个可分配到 token 的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F116f6488912de5138070e9f2058d091d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nOrGL%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u61d681fd" id="u61d681fd" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_i%20%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%7B%5C%5Cpi_%7B%5C%5Ctheta_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bold%7D%7D%7D(y_i%20%5C%5Cmid%20q)%7D%20%5C%5Cright)%5E%7B%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cexp%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsg%7D%5Bs_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%5D%20%5C%5Ccdot%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%7D%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bsg%7D%5B%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%7Cq%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%5D%7D%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F0ff6a833d7c8d7683289b0943e37c893.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22HSEub%22%7D"></card></p><blockquote data-lake-id="ua7bbda69" id="ua7bbda69" style="padding-left: 2em"><p data-lake-id="uf39824b5" id="uf39824b5"><span data-lake-id="ue20052b4" id="ue20052b4">其中</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsg%7D%5B%5C%5Ccdot%5D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fc14e957f90275d3b533ef99205dd928c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RcXJb%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf07434d4" id="uf07434d4">是 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc3393dbc" id="uc3393dbc">stop-gradient</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ud87b612c" id="ud87b612c">。这一步的作用是：</span><strong><span data-lake-id="ue6e4e211" id="ue6e4e211">让 GSPO 这种序列级 ratio 也能写成 token 求和形式</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u41c17f2e" id="u41c17f2e">，并且通过 stop-gradient 控制梯度只沿希望的路径传播</span></p></blockquote><p data-lake-id="u85b939ee" id="u85b939ee"><strong><span data-lake-id="ua96db788" id="ua96db788">三种算法各自的 gating function</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u2ce5de2c" id="u2ce5de2c">，</span><strong><span data-lake-id="uf3811ecc" id="uf3811ecc">GSPO 的</span></strong><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F28d346f735ae2219f3ac7cf9eb7d6c7f.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Sic30%22%7D"></card><strong><span data-lake-id="ud1cae51a" id="ud1cae51a">在同一序列内对 token 不变（token-invariant）</span></strong><span data-lake-id="u10130965" id="u10130965">，而 </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6cb18b3b" id="u6cb18b3b">SAPO/GRPO 是 token-dependent</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ub9def2c0" id="ub9def2c0">​</span></p><p data-lake-id="uce6db41f" id="uce6db41f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7BSAPO%3A%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%26%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BSAPO%7D%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B4%7D%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%20%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctau_i%20(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201))%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Ctau_i%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Ctau_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bpos%7D%7D%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%3E%200%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Ctau_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bneg%7D%7D%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cle%200%2C%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7BGRPO%3A%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%26%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGRPO%7D%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3B%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Cmin(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%201%20%2B%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%3E%200%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmax(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%201%20-%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cle%200%2C%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%5C%5Ctext%7BGSPO%3A%7D%20%5C%5Cquad%20%26%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BGSPO%7D%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3B%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i)%20%5C%5Cequiv%20f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7Bseq%7D%7D(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%3B%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cbegin%7Bcases%7D%20%5C%5Cmin(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%201%20%2B%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%3E%200%2C%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%20%5C%5Cmax(s_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%2C%201%20-%20%5C%5Cvarepsilon)%2C%20%26%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cle%200.%20%5C%5Cend%7Bcases%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F6cb615c0efcd732e792a2082056d46be.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G8lXn%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uf4585539" id="uf4585539"><strong><span data-lake-id="uc79e07df" id="uc79e07df">统一梯度形式， 得到 SAPO/GRPO 共享的梯度模板</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="udd525700" id="udd525700" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20f'_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%5C%5C%2C%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fd80278daf7e303052b082b398f9d850c.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cjZUG%22%7D"></card></p><h3 data-lake-id="bhpqT" id="bhpqT" style="text-align: center"><span data-lake-id="u29efa489" id="u29efa489">🍀</span><span data-lake-id="u0478db0d" id="u0478db0d"> 𝓢𝓐𝓟𝓞–𝓖𝓢𝓟𝓞 𝓒𝓸𝓷𝓷𝓮𝓬𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷: 𝓡𝓮𝓭𝓾𝓬𝓽𝓲𝓸𝓷 𝓽𝓸 𝓪 𝓢𝓮𝓺𝓾𝓮𝓷𝓬𝓮-𝓛𝓮𝓿𝓮𝓵 𝓢𝓸𝓯𝓽 𝓖𝓪𝓽𝓮</span></h3><p data-lake-id="ua9efbab4" id="ua9efbab4"><strong><span data-lake-id="u025c56ab" id="u025c56ab">1）</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u1f23a562" id="u1f23a562" style="color: #70000D">SAPO 的 token 级软门控（梯度权重）的解析式利用恒等式</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id="u730e8bee" id="u730e8bee" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Csigma(x)(1%20-%20%5C%5Csigma(x))%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B(e%5E%7Bx%2F2%7D%20%2B%20e%5E%7B-x%2F2%7D)%5E2%7D%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B4%7D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E2(x%2F2)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F9ef25b7df58760d67a0475731ba21b61.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZkUTj%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u5d5cc46e" id="u5d5cc46e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BSAPO%7D'%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%3D%204%20%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctau_i%20(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201))%20%5C%5Cleft(%201%20-%20%5C%5Csigma(%5C%5Ctau_i%20(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201))%20%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E2%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D%20(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201)%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Feb6278d76f5d20063d6674a1273e24e2.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22yjR5M%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u30606c09" id="u30606c09"><span data-lake-id="u6d3bae3f" id="u6d3bae3f"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="u6f589517" id="u6f589517">2）</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id="u8a4d4ff6" id="u8a4d4ff6" style="color: #70000D">两个关键假设</span></strong></p><ul list="u5869a6ff"><li fid="u59e94fc0" data-lake-id="ude03a75b" id="ude03a75b"><span data-lake-id="u931075b1" id="u931075b1"> </span><strong><span data-lake-id="uc87f2e9a" id="uc87f2e9a">假设 (A1) 小步长/当前策略 (Small-step/on-policy) ，新旧策略差异很小</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ua7044ab1" id="ua7044ab1">，即重要性比率 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Capprox%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7b807d1513e34fd6f30ec5bcb785cc11.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lCRLe%22%7D"></card></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u8e3dc986" id="u8e3dc986" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Clog%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Capprox%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fa34d316270e815828affba8b5906d6d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22CU0mW%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="udd0efbfe"><li fid="ua2d2008e" data-lake-id="u00d7e0b7" id="u00d7e0b7"><strong><span data-lake-id="u74a789b7" id="u74a789b7">假设 (A2) 低序列内离散度 (Low intra-sequence dispersion)，</span></strong><span data-lake-id="uec01d2a3" id="uec01d2a3">定义 Token 的对数比率为</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F114908aedc4e9ed593fe70c9890980ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BHbvB%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ubd1c6754" id="ubd1c6754">，序列的平均对数比率为 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_t%20z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7700ed6beb62ef79b8d10dad00a96630.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Wv8td%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u64694d1f" id="u64694d1f">，假设序列内的方差</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7BVar%7D_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F3cd2bc6de14a2b8f6022ff0f2507e867.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22YY16J%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ub9b9b74e" id="ub9b9b74e"> 很小：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9826a15f" id="u9826a15f" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Ctext%7BVar%7D_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3A%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_t%20(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%20%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%5E2%20%5C%5Capprox%200%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F473e5acb05fe89881bf50c1ac7640f1a.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22FPskn%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u2662b87e" id="u2662b87e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22f_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%5E%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BSAPO%7D'%7D(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%3D%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E2%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D%20(r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%201)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E2%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Clog%20r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%3D%3A%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fce54bb5dff4f8cef1158e7aba74db3d5.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ZZiPR%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="u675e0ba0" id="u675e0ba0"><strong><span data-lake-id="u2d77b6d7" id="u2d77b6d7" style="color: #70000D">3）token 门控均值 ⇒ 序列门控：二阶泰勒展开</span></strong></p><ul list="uafcb2a5c"><li fid="uc1faa1ae" data-lake-id="u0b505506" id="u0b505506"><span data-lake-id="uaea3e473" id="uaea3e473">对光滑函数 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb0b964b494ebaeee0e1491f4616abb5d.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22gJPXK%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u94ae6b96" id="u94ae6b96">在</span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%3D%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F52b28c3656f0c2bab251e8332a60b813.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zyalk%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5322d840" id="u5322d840">处做二阶泰勒展开：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u46f5710c" id="u46f5710c" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%3D%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%2B%20g'_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%20%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20g''_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cxi_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%20%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%5E2%2C%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8512bdef27718f64a3472eeb2bed9b29.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Btrh6%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u2e386992" id="u2e386992">  </span></p><ul list="ucfb7973d"><li fid="u50ca008c" data-lake-id="u5dd20556" id="u5dd20556"><span data-lake-id="u7a158900" id="u7a158900"> 其中 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cxi_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff602bfb77c7ac7b5055c8d2e0114ce98.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22IwOt5%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u6e03f077" id="u6e03f077">介于 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F802b10177b5452ae182f5083e83a031b.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22s7yXT%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u5b91aadd" id="u5b91aadd">与 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F046ae87323d03a070a9d750f0d1ce898.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22nxBxG%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf367e914" id="uf367e914">之间。对 token 求平均后，一阶项因中心化而抵消：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue19e4e3a" id="ue19e4e3a" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%3D%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%2B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20g''_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cxi_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%20-%20%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%5E2%20%5C%5Cright).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F1290347fb8fdda6a47d411ccade35941.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22RPOoX%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="uebad2bba" id="uebad2bba"><strong><span data-lake-id="u209ed26b" id="u209ed26b" style="color: #70000D">4）二阶导的显式形式与统一误差界</span></strong></p><ul list="u7c2bab57"><li fid="u7b9107e9" data-lake-id="u70ff6bdf" id="u70ff6bdf"><span data-lake-id="ud165eae3" id="ud165eae3"> 令 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g_%5C%5Ctau(z)%3D%5C%5Cmathrm%7Bsech%7D%5E2(%5C%5Calpha%20z)%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ff36693c34575e26ce12385d01143f9a6.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sLlTI%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf46dbf71" id="uf46dbf71"> 且 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Calpha%3D%5C%5Ctau%2F2%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F8739bf2ba31792129aea460bc986d418.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22c0hlF%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="uf695f0c7" id="uf695f0c7">，则可直接计算</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u024fe524" id="u024fe524" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22g''_%7B%5C%5Ctau%7D(z)%20%3D%20%5C%5Calpha%5E2%20%5C%5Cleft(%204%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E2(%5C%5Calpha%20z)%20-%206%20%5C%5Ctext%7Bsech%7D%5E4(%5C%5Calpha%20z)%20%5C%5Cright)%2C%20%5C%5Cquad%20%5C%5Csup_z%20%7Cg''_%7B%5C%5Ctau%7D(z)%7C%20%3D%202%5C%5Calpha%5E2%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau%5E2%7D%7B2%7D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F469bbd7e2aa0e6f6843946c6845a3734.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22VRLoW%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u7c2bab57" start="2"><li fid="u7b9107e9" data-lake-id="u8a52a1df" id="u8a52a1df"><span data-lake-id="u161e823e" id="u161e823e"> 因此，token 门控均值与序列门控的偏差可用统一上界控制：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="ue4fecec2" id="ue4fecec2" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22D_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cleft%7C%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_t%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20-%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Cmu_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%5C%5Cright%7C%20%5C%5Cleq%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B2%7D%20%5C%5Csup_z%20%7Cg''_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z)%7C%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BVar%7D_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%3D%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%5E2%7D%7B4%7D%20%5C%5Coperatorname%7BVar%7D_i(%5C%5Ctheta).%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffefd3e4343e1a826e0711c82225b1fde.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22kXq2g%22%7D"></card></p><p data-lake-id="ue555a7cd" id="ue555a7cd"><strong><span data-lake-id="u3d85ec20" id="u3d85ec20" style="color: #70000D">5）从 token 级梯度近似推到序列级梯度（得到 GSPO-like 形式） </span></strong><span data-lake-id="u99106537" id="u99106537"> </span></p><ul list="ua3dc8a83"><li fid="u9e3dcb0b" data-lake-id="u4e3f3416" id="u4e3f3416"><span data-lake-id="uc2081e65" id="uc2081e65"> 从通用梯度形式出发，取 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22r_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta)%5C%5Capprox%201%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Fb3978485e598dcf1f6cece33ee8dd819.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22eOmSw%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="u7959a4f3" id="u7959a4f3">，SAPO 的梯度可近似为</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u97847826" id="u97847826" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BSAPO%7D%7D%20%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2Ffc1188a0dcc570e91329a3a845874659.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Myofr%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="ued8f1909"><li fid="uda303c67" data-lake-id="u0b9d894a" id="u0b9d894a"><span data-lake-id="u590901ac" id="u590901ac"> 再由 </span><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%5C%5Csum_t%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(z_%7Bi%2Ct%7D)%5C%5Capprox%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F872e39883d39f6a2fdebe862db6e6966.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22KDTPv%22%7D"></card><span data-lake-id="ufef0f358" id="ufef0f358">，于是 </span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="uccefa92e" id="uccefa92e" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name="math" value="data:%7B%22code%22%3A%22%5C%5Cbegin%7Baligned%7D%5Cn%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Cmathcal%7BJ%7D_%7B%5C%5Ctext%7BSAPO%7D%7D%20%26%5C%5Capprox%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%5C%5Cleft(%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bt%3D1%7D%5E%7B%7Cy_i%7C%7D%20%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20%5C%5Cpi_%5C%5Ctheta(y_%7Bi%2Ct%7D%20%5C%5Cmid%20q%2C%20y_%7Bi%2C%3Ct%7D)%20%5C%5Cright)%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cright%5D%20%5C%5C%5C%5C%5Cn%26%3D%20%5C%5Cmathbb%7BE%7D%20%5C%5Cleft%5B%20%5C%5Cfrac%7B1%7D%7BG%7D%20%5C%5Csum_%7Bi%3D1%7D%5EG%20g_%7B%5C%5Ctau_i%7D(%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta))%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cnabla_%5C%5Ctheta%20%5C%5Clog%20s_i(%5C%5Ctheta)%20%5C%5C%2C%20%5C%5Cwidehat%7BA%7D_i%20%5C%5Cright%5D.%5Cn%5C%5Cend%7Baligned%7D%22%2C%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F__latex%2F7d4d18bed378d4577deb068d580303ba.svg%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22WOpBX%22%7D"></card></p><ul list="u5adab3ce"><li fid="u3d8635b5" data-lake-id="u33de68c3" id="u33de68c3"><span data-lake-id="ufec56ee2" id="ufec56ee2"> SAPO 退化为与 GSPO 结构相似的</span><strong><span data-lake-id="u06b9a87d" id="u06b9a87d">序列级更新</span></strong><span data-lake-id="ufbc6c7e2" id="ufbc6c7e2">，但门控是连续软门控：</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id="u9807dee9" id="u9807dee9" style="text-align: center"><card type="inline" name=